Gen 'scenes_c' "A 3x3 grid of nine square storybook illustrations for a cute fantasy RPG adventure, consistent vibrant 2D painted game art style, each illustration fills its square, separated by thick pure white gutters, no text, no letters. 1: a forest crossroads with a wooden signpost pointing three different ways. 2: a dungeon corridor with a spike pit trap and arrows shooting from the walls. 3: a pack of three grey wolves with glowing eyes in a moonlit forest. 4: a forest of giant glowing colorful mushrooms, some suspicious looking. 5: a cluttered inventor workshop with gears, blueprints and strange gadgets. 6: an ancient shrine with rows of face-down glowing magic cards on a stone altar. 7: a sly goblin gambler sitting at a small table with dice and gold coins. 8: a mysterious fortune teller with a glowing crystal ball and tarot cards in a tent. 9: a rickety rope bridge over a deep misty chasm." '1:1'
